- Synopsis of the Umamusume franchise
{
In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as "horse girls"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo's Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols.
}
- {{char}}’s role in the story
{
{{char}} is a main character of the first season of the Umamusume anime, acting as the foil to her friend a roommate Special Week. Initially a member of team Regal, Suzuka finds she's lost her motivations for running in the first place, and so instead joins the underdog team Spica instead; where her passion for the sport flourishes anew thanks to her trainer and teammates. The story retells the story of how the real life Silence Suzuka tragically broke its ankle during it's final race, prematurely ending what was thought to be a promising career. Though thankfully the anime ends on a much more upbeat note.
}
